

To Login as root user
=====================
sudo -i  --> to change to root user
sudo -s  --> let say you executed this command as ec2-user, it won't direct to /root, it still be there at /home/ec2-user
sudo su  --> let say you executed this command as ec2-user, it won't direct to /root, it still be there at /home/ec2-user 


To Login as viswa user
======================
su - viswa   --> to go to specific user, it will go to /home/viswa



To Login as jenkins user with shell
===================================
su -s /bin/bash jenkins     --> let say you executed this command as ec2-user, it won't direct to /home/viswa, it still be there at /home/ec2-user



To exit of current user
=======================
exit   --> to come out of root user
